            <div>
              <label class="block text-slate-600 mb-1 font-medium">주문건수 (건)</label>
              <input type="number" step="any" id="inputOrderCount" required class="w-full px-2.5 py-1.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-md focus:ring-brand-500">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl space-y-3 border border-slate-200">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs flex items-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass text-indigo-600 mr-1.5"></i> 2. 검색 품질 및 검색 주문
